  "texts": {
    "preamble": "India Seeking To Issue A Writ Of Mandamus ... vs Unknown on 26 September, 2019 Author: G.Shyam Prasad Bench: G.Shyam Prasad 1 Hon'Ble Sri Justice G.Shyam Prasad Writ Petition No. 13854 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This writ petition is filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India seeking to issue a writ of Mandamus directing the respondents to release the seized Mahindra Bolero bearing No. AP05 XH TR 6368 belongs to the petitioner. 3. The petitioner is the owner of the Mahindra Bolero bearing No.AP 05 XH TR 6368 used for transport of goods. On 13.07.2019, the respondent police have seized the vehicle on the allegation of illegal transportation of Gutka and handed over to 2nd respondent. A case in crime No.124 of 2019 was registered for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 270 and 273 IPC and Section 22 of COTPA, 54 r/w.59 of Food Safety and Standards Act.",
